   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reality Check Phase IV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reality Check Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reality Check program/study is an unconventional 5-year study to give voice to poor people to strengthen their rights as suppor to the      SWAPs in health and educ supported by Sida 2007-2011. A team of       Int/b-deshes stay 1 week/yearl in same famils in 3 sites: urban,      semiurb, rural.A report is dessiminated each year. A broad            Referencegroup in B-desh supports the dissemination.Cons by procurem.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reality Check programmet/studien i B-desh har som m&#xe5;l att ge r&#xf6;st &#xe5;t  fattiga m&#xe4;nniskor f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rstka deras r&#xe4;ttigheter i b&#xe5;da            sektorprogrmn f&#xf6;r h&#xe4;lsa och utbildning (2007-2011).Studien &#xe4;r 5 &#xe5;rig, okonventionell metod, ett team (int/bdes)bor hos samma familjer i tre olika siter(urban, semi-urban, rural),samlar informtin som delges i   rapport/&#xe5;rl. Bred refernsgrupp ger st&#xf6;d &#xe5;t spridn.Konsult/upphandlad.</narrative>
  </description>
